19. What does "Unnecessary stubbing" mean? How do you fix it?
Cause: A mock was stubbed but never used.
Fix: Remove the stubbing or use lenient():

lenient().when(mock.unusedMethod()).thenReturn(...);

20. How do you debug a test where verify() fails unexpectedly?
Use Mockito.mockingDetails(mock).printInvocations() to log all calls to the mock.
